  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till enskild organisation Zanzibar Legal Services Center som     bidrar med MR &#xf6;vervakning och debatt samt dialog med Zanzibars        regering f&#xf6;r att st&#xe4;rka respekt f&#xf6;r m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter samt med    st&#xf6;d via barfotajurister till m&#xe4;nniskor p&#xe5; Zanzibar.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to civil society organisation Zanzibar Legal Services Center  which contributes to Human Rights monitoring and debate and dialogue  with the Zanzibari Government to promote respect for human rights and to provide access to justice through paralegals.</narrative>
  </description>
